  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Bundles custom CSS into khamsin.css: khamsin.json's css files and referenced libraries' stylesheets are emitted in the base layer between theme and utilities, so consumers link one stylesheet, including correct merging of referenced library configs. Emits a Tailwind-compatible preflight in the base layer, extracts class attributes from render fragments declared in @code blocks, accepts fully qualified Khamsin.Cn/Khamsin.Kx calls, adds visible/invisible utilities and animate-in fade defaults, and fixes negative fraction utilities (the minus sign was dropped from -translate-x-1/2 style values) plus the attribute emitter, the metadata reader and the internal @property registrations that had gone missing.",
